{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0d6f7445677059629a6e11ffae7f7a6a2cba4e33a724909550b77b541828432b", "ja": "（今回のライブは趣向を変えて、かくし芸や\nマジックなどのショーを織り交ぜてみた。結果は……）", "zh": "（这次的演唱会转换方向，\n试着穿插才艺和魔术等表演，结果……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "6a3b713da6a01a7ed94c9e02e0a7f63b8630bac4334e2e1911dd71e19c50327e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでした～。\nライブ、盛り上がりましたね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你辛苦了～\n演唱会的气氛很热烈呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "9e6157539b705de74fea695f942c690e7033872c429bde5402fa4d69a6765c13", "ja": "今回の企画は、{$P$}さんの\nお手柄ですね～。ほめて差し上げましょう～。", "zh": "这次企划成功，是{$P$}先生的功劳～\n我就赐予你赞扬之词吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f3620b52e333771ca45c677dca94aa63027c119300c054c5ccd047ad466a4e30", "ja": "お疲れさま、朋花。\nカクテルグラスを使ったマジック、綺麗だったな！", "zh": "辛苦你了，朋花。\n你用鸡尾酒杯变的魔术非常美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cb7f050e50379a58f43a8117103a5b6d9dcec3b2d7517ec9e968b14e8c2589d4", "ja": "テーブルマジックだとファンとの距離が近くなるから、\n少し心配だったけど。トラブルもなく終わったな。", "zh": "餐桌魔术和粉丝的距离比较近，我本来还有点担心。\n幸好没出状况，顺利结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "e4c8b682ed028c01187ccde1c8515be09ea4b3d71bc306d0a6736137a289e01d", "ja": "当然です～。それに子豚ちゃんたちが、神聖な聖母の\nステージで、トラブルを起こすはずがありません～。", "zh": "那是当然的～更何况是由神圣的圣母所表演，\n小猪们不可能会在表演中引起事端的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ed50bcb47d33a30a4364037c26ac6bdca2804ea9ed4e61b913cc27ab209982c1", "ja": "はは、たしかにそうだな。今回のステージは、\n朋花にとってもいい経験になったかな。", "zh": "哈哈，你说得对。\n这次表演，对朋花来说也是一次很好的经验吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "df1f0511a43e9a58ea629cfe12e2c67b424240412869fbef41c8578afbfbbc6c", "ja": "そうですね～。普段のステージとは違って、\nなかなか楽しかったですよ～。", "zh": "也是呢～\n不同于平时的表演，还挺有趣的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "9ebd4b2f3d315c067a9f62c5d6a89b101829bf8de9c325b7b89908c3ddb3b373", "ja": "それに、こうして子豚ちゃん達の喜ぶ顔を間近で\n見られて、うれしかったです～。", "zh": "而且能像这样近距离看见小猪们高兴的表情，\n我也很高兴～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4c2c1b58a84aeae086608e627d74db73ce6e879b965ddc5e80a65d95998aa71f", "ja": "そうか。しかし、朋花のマジックのタネは\n本当にちっともわからなかったな……。", "zh": "这样啊。不过朋花变的魔术，\n我真的完全看不出手法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "a380df14d66d4b781cb35a1f684054ce0adc72ef4ff3f1b20dfa07f8bc92dc4c", "ja": "うふふ、当然ですよ～。タネがわかってしまっては、\nマジックになりませんからね～。", "zh": "呵呵，那是当然的啊～\n要是看得出手法，就称不上是魔术了嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "5db601ccf9acbef017d13dcc22ac27e2933530b628398d8fd779eeef41b0722c", "ja": "どうしても知りたいのであれば、そうですね～。\n特別に、教えて差し上げてもかまいませんが～。", "zh": "如果你坚持想知道的话，这个嘛～\n要我破例教你也不是不行喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1012_p", "source_sha256": "438cdff45910f4a294444a814a9f97dbd4242adb9097032b2a6b1ae39adcc985", "ja": "え、いいのか？", "zh": "咦，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "109507a5ba4539859421698e0e549c0be6475a08c1ce30dcf144206f4b80e229", "ja": "ええ、かまいませんよ～。\nけど、タネを知ってしまったら……。", "zh": "嗯，我不介意透漏喔～\n不过，如果知道了手法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "910ef83ee59773b079e235eebed155f378551ed25989db881eaf6d5b28fe5229", "ja": "{$P$}さんの心の色が、変わって\nしまうかもしれませんけど、かまいませんか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生的心可能会变成别的色彩，\n这样也没关系吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1015_p", "source_sha256": "551c492acaa9a584775e766db3cb746b085f0ad46edd3123845596c66ea91615", "ja": "心の色が……変わる？", "zh": "心会……变成别的色彩？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "bf386dd4e678c40d8b81a0de4e377c006901189ba014695c6f88e61e5943cf8f", "ja": "ええ、そうですよ～。心が私色に染められて、\n私のことが、大好きになってしまうんです～。", "zh": "嗯，没错～你的心会染上我的颜色，\n然后变得超级喜欢我～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1017_p", "source_sha256": "edd954c977eea01ce192dbb388ebe0601148b57859d8b91032f618a04b673567", "ja": "なんだか想像ができないけど……\n染められると困りそうだから、やっぱりやめておくよ。", "zh": "我不太能想像……\n被染色感觉有点困扰，还是算了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "022acce4c0fe9d388e3fd7482dfcc923ccc516a286cf9294b288e7c0fe09604b", "ja": "賢明な判断ですね～。\nけど、そのほうがいいと思います～。", "zh": "真是明智的判断呢～\n不过，我觉得你这样比较好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0063_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "70e2ce74aa5acf71db009a6fd24751f7c7562f3457722a04bce194bb073563cb", "ja": "{$P$}さんはプロデューサーさん。\n子豚ちゃんでは、ありませんからね～。ふふっ。", "zh": "因为{$P$}先生是制作人，\n而不是小猪啊～呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
